# =====================================================================
# WARNING -- `git clean -fdx` (or -fdX) FROM THIS DIRECTORY DELETES
# EVERY EXPERIMENT RESULT IN THE REPOSITORY.
#
# The results trees below are ignored, so -x removes them. As of
# 2026-07-29 that is ~47 GB under r2_interpretability_transfer/results,
# ~3.5 GB under archive/retired_research_roots/ and ~230 MB under
# archive/legacy/. None of it is synced off this machine. This already
# destroyed completed experiment artefacts three times on 2026-07-28,
# when the hazard lived in the nested r2 repository; consolidating to
# one root repository did not remove it, it enlarged it.
#
# Use `git clean -fd` without -x, or clean an explicit subpath.
# =====================================================================

# Large data directories (generic results/ matches at any depth; explicit
# per-research lines document the canonical roots)
data/
results/
r2_interpretability_transfer/results/
archive/legacy/r2_retired_scope_20260729/results/
archive/retired_research_roots/r0_shared_interpretability_framework/results/
archive/retired_research_roots/r1_encoder_interpretability_benchmark/results/

# Experiment tracking
wandb/
r2_interpretability_transfer/wandb/
archive/retired_research_roots/r1_encoder_interpretability_benchmark/wandb/

# Runtime logs (keep documentation logs, exclude runtime logs/)
logs/*
!logs/README.md
r2_interpretability_transfer/logs/
archive/legacy/r2_retired_scope_20260729/logs/
archive/legacy/r2_transfer_log_snapshots_20260728/results_snapshot_*/
archive/legacy/r2_transfer_log_snapshots_20260728/convergence_control_backup/
archive/retired_research_roots/r1_encoder_interpretability_benchmark/logs/
*.log

# Downloaded third-party resources stay on B/H200; track only local metadata.
external_resources/*
!external_resources/README.md
!external_resources/setup_h200_external_env.sh
!external_resources/manifests/
external_resources/manifests/*
!external_resources/manifests/*.md

# Retired live-root names. These are quarantined to prevent accidental
# resurrection after the 2026-07-16 structure migration.
ProteinInterpret/
benchmark_encoder/
paper_r2_nature_mi/
r2_decoder_sparse_readout_audit/
project_records/

# Archived repositories retain old history outside the live Git graph.
archive/legacy/nested_git_history_*/

# Frozen legacy document containing a local access token.
archive/legacy/R2_RESEARCH_PROPOSAL_v1.md

# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Environments
.venv/
.conda/
*.egg-info/
.env.local

# Large binary / model files
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.pkl
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.npy
*.npz
*.parquet
*.feather
*.arrow
*.pdf
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# Bioinformatics data files
*.vcf.gz
*.vcf.bgz
*.dat.gz
*.tsv.gz
*.bam
*.bai
*.fasta
*.fastq
*.fasta.gz
*.fastq.gz

# System
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Sync tool
.mutagenignore
.claude/
